[b]Eve (Stellar Blade) v1.5.0[/b]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Peony joins the six existing Eve outfits, with body-fitting clothing and CSS body-shape controls.
[*]Four palette templates: Black and white floral (default), CNS original, Hydrangea recolor and Peony recolor.
[*]Optional glowing, flowing trim with adjustable glow and flow speed.
[*]Removable clothing pieces, facial animation and support for customized Genessa doubles.
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Reduced excessive Eve chest and glute motion with corrected motion limits.
[/list]

[b]Updating[/b]
Close the game. Install CSS v1.0.0-beta.12 and its matching CSS Shared Assets download, then replace CSS_EveStellarBlade_eins0fx_P with the folder from this ZIP. Keep each package's three files together. Remove superseded CSS_AstralSharedAssets_P and CSS_LocomotionSharedAssets_P folders if present. Keep your CSS settings and saved profiles.

Small clipping in some poses or at extreme body settings may remain. Slipstream is not included.

Peony/Hydrangea source: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stellarblade/mods/1724]Peony/Hydrangea V2 CNS and recolor pack[/url]. CSS adaptation and integration by eins0fx.
